  "notes": "Uses the Catppuccin Macchiato palette (base #24273a, surface0 #363a4f, text #cad3f5), and each metric gets its own pastel series colour: blue watch time, pink cards, teal words, sky episodes, green words/min. Section headers are small tracked uppercase labels followed by a hairline rule, with a muted right-aligned hint ('Click a bar to open its sessions', 'Rolling 7 days, gaps mean too little data'). Charts sit in thin-bordered, 8px-rounded cards with dashed gridlines. Clicking a bar jumps to the Sessions tab filtered to that day; clicking a title cross-filters the page; ↗ opens the title. One chart (New Words per 1,000) renders empty axes with no message."
